# L §4.2 Keys as values: "A key of an integer index is also an int", so an int plus a key of an integer index is int
# arithmetic: c[1, 2, 3] = 1 + 2 + 3 = 6.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

index cnt = int 0..3
def c[n1 in cnt, n2 in cnt, n3 in cnt]: int = n1 + n2 + n3 at reader

ask q: c[1, 2, 3] law 2026-01-01
=== expect
q: 6
  law date 2026-01-01, cut 2026-12-31
